## 📌 Overview

Industrial temperature control system for alkaline plating bath applications featuring:

- ✅ PT100 temperature sensing with 60°C setpoint
- ✅ Water level safety interlock
- ✅ 3-phase SSR power switching (12kW total)
- ✅ Hysteresis-based temperature control
- ✅ Proteus simulation ready

