## 🔌 Pin Connections (ATmega328P DIP-28)

| Function | Arduino Pin | Chip Pin |
|----------|-------------|----------|
| PT100 Input | A0 | Pin 23 |
| Level Sensor | D2 | Pin 4 |
| SSR Control | **D11** | **Pin 17** |
| Serial TX | TX | Pin 2 |
| Serial RX | RX | Pin 3 |

**Power:** Pin 7 (VCC) → +5V | Pin 8 (GND) → GND | Pin 20 (AVCC) → +5V | Pin 22 (GND) → GND

