## 🎯 Control Logic

### Temperature Reference

| Temp | PT100 (Ω) | ADC Value |
|------|-----------|:---------:|
| 20°C | 107.8 | 530 |
| 60°C | 123.2 | 565 |
| 100°C | 138.5 | 593 |

### Control States

| Condition | Heater |
|-----------|:------:|
| Water OK AND ADC < 550 | 🔥 ON |
| Water OK AND ADC > 580 | ❄️ OFF |
| Water LOW | ⚠️ OFF (Safety) |
| ADC 550-580 | 🔄 Maintain |

