## 🚀 Getting Started

### Installation
1. Clone this repository
2. Open `heater_control.ino` in Arduino IDE
3. Select Board: Arduino Uno
4. Upload to ATmega328P

### Proteus Simulation
1. Open `heater_control.dsn`
2. Set ATmega clock: 16MHz
3. Upload .hex file
4. Run simulation (F12)
5. Open Virtual Terminal (9600 baud)

