## ⚠️ Safety Features

| Feature | Implementation |
|---------|---------------|
| Low Level Cutoff | Level relay interlock |
| Over-temperature | Software limit |
| Sensor Fault | Watchdog timer (3s) |
| Emergency Stop | Hardware E-stop |
| Circuit Protection | 32A + 3×10A breakers |

