## 🔧 Troubleshooting

| Issue | Solution |
|-------|----------|
| Heater won't turn ON | Check SSR_PIN = 11 matches hardware |
| Heater won't turn OFF | ADC increases with temp - verify logic |
| No serial output | Virtual Terminal: 9600 baud |
| Relay chattering | Add hysteresis band |
| Simulation won't start | Connect VCC (7,20) & GND (8,22) |

